ased on Classic Works</p></span></div><div data-rid="12e0c15b-307e-4347-a47e-9cdf3b045ec7" class="r-ruxndh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Curriculum built on foundational texts by Bastiat, Hayek, and von Mises—providing intellectual authority other content lacks.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-replo-component-root="carousel" data-replo-part="slide" data-replo-root-id="replo-carousel:Rdtr2:" data-slide-index="4" data-slide-source-index="4" data-is-cloned="true" data-slide-id="replo-carousel:Rdtr2::slide:4:4" id="replo-carousel:Rdtr2::slide:4:4:Rbdtr2::clone:4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" role="group" aria-label="Slide 5" style="display:flex;height:100%;padding:0;margin:0;backface-visibility:hidden;flex-shrink:0;position:relative" data-component-id="beeb4a0d-d1c1-4aed-9ce6-b5709166461f" class="r-avm3xz"><div data-rid="beeb4a0d-d1c1-4aed-9ce6-b5709166461f" class="r-1yt15ni"><div data-rid="0ddcf8d3-f17d-4ae8-9896-baa851f31152" class="r-ohz1yr"><picture data-rid="7485037c-36f6-4d5f-bcd8-4b672dd0ced6" class="r-xyd3g9"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/0902e791-a036-4770-8696-ae5da17fb9dd?width=64" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/0902e791-a036-4770-8696-ae5da17fb9dd?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/0902e791-a036-4770-8696-ae5da17fb9dd?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/0902e791-a036-4770-8696-ae5da17fb9dd" class="r-jkhwvz" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="17331cdb-b0a6-46ff-b6b1-5e83ee11151d" class="r-xpl8j9"><div data-rid="02fe53d1-f1e1-4118-a4a0-93a7031b1ba6" class="r-14pjjrw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Real-World Application</p></span></div><div 